================================================================================
6. PRIVACY (GDPR) — Trattamento dei dati
================================================================================
Nexflamma acts as Data Controller pursuant to Art. 13 of Regulation (EU)
2016/679. Typographus stores documents and preferences locally on your device.
For licensing it sends a hardware identifier (HWID) to Nexflamma and checks for
updates. Your content leaves the device only when you use a feature that needs
it: publishing a community template (stored by Nexflamma with your account),
creating a share link (the document is uploaded to file.io, a third-party
service, for 7 days), opening it in Overleaf or publishing to your WordPress
site (sent to those services). Details: https://nexflamma.net/#/privacy.
To exercise your rights (Artt. 15-22 GDPR) contact privacy@nexflamma.net.
I contenuti escono dal computer solo con queste funzioni, su tua richiesta.

